{"id":"wb-3-103","name":"大士阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大士阁","text":"大士阁位于中国广西壮族自治区北海市合浦县山口镇永安村，因阁内供奉观音大士而得名，1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n永安村是明代所建的沿海卫所之一，大士阁位于其中心位置，坐北朝南，由前后两座重檐歇山顶楼阁连为一体，面阔三间（9.7米），总进深六间（16.4米），均为穿斗式木构架。屋脊以龙凤鸟兽等雕塑装饰，外檐及斗拱等绘有彩画，工艺精美。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E5%A3%AB%E9%98%81","revisionId":91700167,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91700167","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/730234736f10b75fe21f5a66.jpg","title":"Dashi_Pavilion.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dashi_Pavilion.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/Dashi_Pavilion.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Huanghsindon","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Dashi Pavilion","width":320,"height":213}}